1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:26,000
♪ Hello, hello, hello to you! Hello, hello, I'm happy to see you! Wave hello, wave hello — let's play and learn, here we go! ♪

2
00:00:26,733 --> 00:00:34,733
Hi friends! It's me, Miss Poppy! Can you wave hi? Hiii!

3
00:00:38,133 --> 00:00:46,133
Today we're going to say lots of words together. Are you ready? Let's go!

4
00:00:46,133 --> 00:00:56,277
Our first word is… hi! Hi! Can you say hi?

5
00:00:59,277 --> 00:01:04,461
Hi! You did it!

6
00:01:04,761 --> 00:01:06,753
Who gives the best hugs?

7
00:01:07,961 --> 00:01:18,105
Mama! Mmm-ma-ma. Lips together — mmm. Can you say mama?

8
00:01:21,105 --> 00:01:26,289
Mama! Great job!

9
00:01:26,589 --> 00:01:29,949
Up, up, up!

10
00:01:31,056 --> 00:01:38,352
Dada! Da-da. Can you say dada?

11
00:01:41,356 --> 00:01:46,540
Dada! Yay!

12
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:52,096
Peekaboo! Who's that?

13
00:01:53,207 --> 00:01:59,799
Baby! B-b-baby. Can you say baby?

14
00:02:02,807 --> 00:02:07,991
Baby! Good job!

15
00:02:08,291 --> 00:02:12,635
The duck is leaving. What do we say?

16
00:02:13,735 --> 00:02:21,735
Bye-bye! Can you wave and say bye-bye?

17
00:02:24,735 --> 00:02:29,919
Bye-bye, duck! You did it!

18
00:02:29,919 --> 00:02:36,511
Let's look in my toy box! What's inside? Hmm…

19
00:02:36,819 --> 00:02:40,683
Look! Bounce, bounce!

20
00:02:41,561 --> 00:02:48,857
It's a ball! Ball. Can you say ball? B-b-ball!

21
00:02:51,861 --> 00:02:57,045
Ball! Great job!

22
00:02:57,345 --> 00:03:00,105
Vroom, vroom!

23
00:03:01,087 --> 00:03:08,383
Car! Car goes vroom! Can you say car?

24
00:03:11,387 --> 00:03:16,571
Car! Vroom, vroom! Yay!

25
00:03:16,871 --> 00:03:22,127
Open… shhh… let's read!

26
00:03:23,237 --> 00:03:30,533
Book! B-b-book. Can you say book?

27
00:03:33,537 --> 00:03:40,129
Book! You're so smart!

28
00:03:40,437 --> 00:03:43,557
Pop! Pop! Pop!

29
00:03:44,671 --> 00:03:51,263
Bubbles! Can you say bubbles? Buh-buh-bubbles!

30
00:03:54,271 --> 00:03:59,455
Bubbles! Pop, pop!

31
00:03:59,755 --> 00:04:04,051
Up, up, up… uh-oh!

32
00:04:05,155 --> 00:04:10,339
Block! Can you say block?

33
00:04:13,339 --> 00:04:18,523
Block! Good job!

34
00:04:18,523 --> 00:04:30,779
You're doing so good! Let's stand up and wiggle! Wiggle, wiggle, wiggle… and stop!

35
00:04:33,789 --> 00:04:38,973
Let's visit the farm! Who lives on the farm?

36
00:04:39,273 --> 00:04:42,033
Woof, woof!

37
00:04:43,140 --> 00:04:51,140
Dog! The dog says woof! Can you say dog?

38
00:04:54,140 --> 00:04:59,324
Dog! Woof, woof! Yay!

39
00:04:59,624 --> 00:05:02,144
Meow!

40
00:05:03,257 --> 00:05:11,257
Cat! The cat says meow. Can you say cat?

41
00:05:14,257 --> 00:05:19,441
Cat! Meow! Good job!

42
00:05:19,741 --> 00:05:20,917
Moooo!

43
00:05:22,941 --> 00:05:30,941
Cow! Round lips — oooh. Moo! Can you say cow?

44
00:05:33,941 --> 00:05:39,125
Cow! Moo! You did it!

45
00:05:39,425 --> 00:05:42,209
Quack, quack!

46
00:05:43,325 --> 00:05:48,509
Duck! Can you say duck?

47
00:05:51,509 --> 00:05:56,693
Duck! Quack, quack! Great job!

48
00:05:56,993 --> 00:06:00,329
Swim, swim, swim!

49
00:06:01,429 --> 00:06:11,573
Fish! Can you make fish lips? Fishy face! Can you say fish?

50
00:06:14,573 --> 00:06:19,757
Fish! So silly! Good job!

51
00:06:19,757 --> 00:06:29,197
I'm getting hungry! Are you hungry? Let's eat!

52
00:06:29,497 --> 00:06:32,281
Mmm, milk!

53
00:06:33,397 --> 00:06:45,653
Milk! Mmm-milk. Lips together — mmm. Can you say milk?

54
00:06:48,664 --> 00:06:53,848
Milk! Yum!

55
00:06:54,148 --> 00:06:56,668
Crunch!

56
00:06:57,781 --> 00:07:02,965
Apple! Can you say apple?

57
00:07:05,965 --> 00:07:12,557
Apple! Crunch, crunch! Yay!

58
00:07:12,865 --> 00:07:16,225
Peel, peel, peel!

59
00:07:17,332 --> 00:07:23,924
Banana! Ba-na-na. Can you say banana?

60
00:07:26,932 --> 00:07:32,116
Banana! Great job!

61
00:07:32,416 --> 00:07:35,536
Munch, munch!

62
00:07:36,649 --> 00:07:41,833
Cookie! Can you say cookie?

63
00:07:44,833 --> 00:07:51,425
Cookie! Yummy! Good job!

64
00:07:51,733 --> 00:07:54,493
Open wide!

65
00:07:55,600 --> 00:08:03,600
Eat! Can you pretend to eat? Num, num, num! Can you say eat?

66
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:13,192
Eat! Num, num! You did it!

67
00:08:13,200 --> 00:08:22,640
Wow, twenty words! Let's clap! Clap, clap, clap!

68
00:08:25,940 --> 00:08:32,708
Uh-oh, no more bubbles… do you want more?

69
00:08:33,808 --> 00:08:40,400
More! Can you say more? Mmm-more!

70
00:08:43,408 --> 00:08:50,704
More! Here are more bubbles! Yay!

71
00:08:51,008 --> 00:08:54,344
Up, up, up!

72
00:08:55,444 --> 00:09:02,036
Up! Can you reach up high? Can you say up?

73
00:09:05,044 --> 00:09:10,228
Up! Great job!

74
00:09:10,528 --> 00:09:13,288
Ready… set…

75
00:09:14,394 --> 00:09:20,986
Go! Can you say go? Ready, set…

76
00:09:23,994 --> 00:09:31,290
Go! Choo choo! You did it!

77
00:09:31,594 --> 00:09:37,330
No more food… what do we say?

78
00:09:38,430 --> 00:09:47,870
All done! Hands up — all done! Can you say all done?

79
00:09:50,870 --> 00:09:56,054
All done! Good job!

80
00:09:56,354 --> 00:09:58,634
Aww!

81
00:09:59,734 --> 00:10:07,030
Hug! Can you give yourself a big hug? Can you say hug?

82
00:10:10,034 --> 00:10:16,626
Hug! I love hugs! Good job!

83
00:10:16,934 --> 00:10:19,694
Hop, hop!

84
00:10:20,801 --> 00:10:27,393
Shoe! Shh-oe. Can you say shoe?

85
00:10:30,401 --> 00:10:35,585
Shoe! Great job!

86
00:10:35,885 --> 00:10:38,309
Boing!

87
00:10:39,418 --> 00:10:44,602
Hat! Can you say hat?

88
00:10:47,602 --> 00:10:52,786
Hat! So silly! Yay!

89
00:10:53,086 --> 00:10:55,846
Splish, splash!

90
00:10:56,953 --> 00:11:03,545
Bath! Can you say bath?

91
00:11:06,553 --> 00:11:11,737
Bath! Splish, splash! Good job!

92
00:11:12,037 --> 00:11:16,333
Shhh… it's nighttime.

93
00:11:17,437 --> 00:11:25,437
Moon! Round lips — oooh. Moon. Can you say moon?

94
00:11:28,437 --> 00:11:33,621
Moon! Beautiful! Good job!

95
00:11:33,921 --> 00:11:37,281
Teddy is sleepy…

96
00:11:38,388 --> 00:11:45,684
Night-night! Can you say night-night?

97
00:11:48,688 --> 00:11:55,280
Night-night, teddy! You did it — thirty words!

98
00:11:55,288 --> 00:12:05,432
Wow! You said SO many words today! Let's say a few again, super fast!

99
00:12:05,732 --> 00:12:10,028
Ball! Dog! Milk! Up! Moon!

100
00:12:10,328 --> 00:12:17,624
You are amazing! I'm so proud of you!

101
00:12:17,628 --> 00:12:47,132
Hey… do you remember the cow? What does the cow say? Moooo! And the duck? Quack, quack! I know a place with LOTS of animals… and they make SO many funny sounds! Let's go find them together. Come on — it's right here!

102
00:12:47,332 --> 00:13:12,632
♪ Goodbye, goodbye, it's time to go! Goodbye, goodbye, I love you so! Wave bye-bye, wave bye-bye — see you soon, my friend, bye-bye! ♪
